            <packagedElement xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent" xmi:type="uml:Class">
               <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent"/>
                  <body>Role given to a represented variable in the context of a dimensional data structure to identify the universes associated with data points. The variable acts as a field in the compound identifier (the key structure) to disambiguate the cells in the multi-dimensional "cube".</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>DimensionComponent</name>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity"/>
                     <body>Indicates whether categories at a specific level can be combined to provide the value for their shared parent category. Value is True if categories can be added together (collapsed) to create higher-level categories.

An example would be age categories. Five-year age categories can be collapsed into 10-year age categories.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>1</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent-categoricalAdditivity-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>1</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>categoricalAdditivity</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#Boolean"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFDataStructure.DimensionComponent-identifier" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DimensionComponent-identifier" xmi:type="uml:Property">
