                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataStructure.InstanceVariable-takesSubstantiveValuesFrom"/>
                     <body>cdi:takesSubstantiveValuesFrom - the substantive value domain (the set of valid, meaningful values) for this variable.</body>
